@startuml US_3_1_4_C2_Impl
title US 3.1.4 - Feedback ao utilizador (Implementacao)

node "Browser" {
  component Page as "Página/Form\n(submit, loading)"
  component Toast as "ToastContainer\nsuccess/error"
}

component FormSvc as "Serviço da feature\nvalidação + REST"
component Api as "TodoApi\ncontrollers REST"

Page --> FormSvc : submit/validate
FormSvc --> Api : POST/PUT/DELETE\nwithCredentials
Api --> FormSvc : 2xx / 4xx (ModelState)
FormSvc --> Toast : mensagens globais
FormSvc --> Page : inline errors + loading off

@enduml
